# Pattern: the delta-sigma output on J8 steps with the UFG clock; PITCH
# sends it to the OSC; B1 held 1 s writes a new pattern. Root page (B3 held):
# B1 cycles the scale system off (grey) -> 12-TET (blue) -> JI (amber).
pot 1 0
pot 2 0.5
pot 3 0
pot 4 0
pot 5 0
pot 6 0
wait 2500
tap b2                     # UFG
wait 300
pot 1 0
pot 1 0.55                 # TIME ~16 Hz clock
wait 300
tap b2                     # Pattern
wait 300
expect led b2 amber
pot 2 0
pot 2 1                    # LENGTH 16
pot 1 0
pot 1 0.6                  # CHANCE: new values
wait 1500
expect cvrange 8 > 0.5
hold b1 1300               # a new pattern
wait 500
expect alive
pot 4 0
pot 4 1                    # PITCH: delta-sigma to the OSC
wait 1500
expect finite
expect unclipped
# scale system on the Root page
press b3
wait 300
tap b1
wait 200
release b3
wait 300
expect led b3 blue
press b3
wait 300
tap b1
wait 200
release b3
wait 300
expect led b3 amber
press b3
wait 300
tap b1
wait 200
release b3
wait 300
expect led b3 grey
expect alive
